
================================================================
 CORTEX-M SECURITY POSTURE  (family: none)
================================================================
 (1) IDENTITY (SYSINFO)
   CHIP_ID                0x10002927  (PART=0x0002 REV=0x1 MANUF=0x927)
   PLATFORM               0x00000002 (ASIC)
   GITREF                 0xabcd1234
 (2) READOUT PROTECTION
   On-chip protection     NONE — RP2040 has no internal flash + no readout-protection fuse.
   Real gate              the EXTERNAL QSPI flash (XIP @0x10000000) — readable unless QSPI is disabled.
================================================================
 NOTE: reading any of the above proves the AHB-AP is OPEN -> internal flash is dumpable now.
================================================================
